{"ticker":"IP","updated":"2026-11-13T23:36:19Z","profile":{"longName":"International Paper Company","shortName":"International Paper Company","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.internationalpaper.com","fullTimeEmployees":62602,"marketCap":18234214400,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":12.520045,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.75416553,"pegRatio":1.58,"targetMeanPrice":42.3,"targetHighPrice":51.0,"targetLowPrice":35.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.004,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.29775,"operatingMargins":0.04028,"profitMargins":-0.14319,"totalRevenue":24177999872,"beta":0.941,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":50.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":29.26,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.45},"summary":"International Paper Company produces and sells renewable fiber-based packaging in North America, Latin America, Europe, South America, and North Africa. It operates through two segments, Packaging Solutions North America and Packaging Solutions EMEA. The company offers linerboard, medium, whitetop, and saturating kraft; and converts containerboard into corrugated boxes, bulk bins, shipping containers and specialty packaging through its converting facilities. Its products support customers in various industries, such as food and beverage, agriculture, industrial manufacturing, personal care pharmaceuticals and consumer goods. The company was founded in 1898 and is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee.","summary_zh":"國際紙業公司在北美、拉丁美洲、歐洲、南美和北非生產和銷售再生纖維包裝。它透過兩個部門運作：北美包裝解決方案部門和歐洲、中東和非洲包裝解決方案部門。該公司提供掛麵牛皮紙、中牛皮紙、白面牛皮紙和飽和牛皮紙；並透過其加工設施將箱板紙加工成瓦楞紙箱、散裝箱、運輸貨櫃和特殊包裝。其產品為食品和飲料、農業、工業製造、個人護理藥品和消費品等各行業的客戶提供支援。該公司成立於 1898 年，總部位於田納西州孟菲斯。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"包裝與容器","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":46.28,"h":46.39,"l":45.36,"c":45.57,"v":3748300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":45.45,"h":46.27,"l":45.22,"c":46.24,"v":4861700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":46.41,"h